diff -ru '--exclude=.git' /work/crate/pulldown-cmark/specs/math.txt /work/fixed/pulldown-cmark/specs/math.txt
--- /work/crate/pulldown-cmark/specs/math.txt	2025-02-12 16:07:29.000000000 +0000
+++ /work/fixed/pulldown-cmark/specs/math.txt	2026-07-08 00:08:00.000000000 +0000
@@ -399,6 +399,31 @@
 <p>$}$] $$</p>
 ````````````````````````````````
 
+The inline math closer cannot be immediately followed by a digit.
+The opener can be, though.
+Display math isn't subject to this rule.
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+$1$2$3
+
+$1$2$3$
+
+$1{$2$}3$
+
+$$1$$2$$3
+
+$$1$$2$$3$$
+
+$$1{$$2$$}3$$
+.
+<p>$1$2$3</p>
+<p>$1$2<span class="math math-inline">3</span></p>
+<p><span class="math math-inline">1{$2$}3</span></p>
+<p><span class="math math-display">1</span>2$$3</p>
+<p><span class="math math-display">1</span>2<span class="math math-display">3</span></p>
+<p><span class="math math-display">1{$$2$$}3</span></p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
