+
+Link must be separated from title by at least one space
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+[a](https://example.com"test")
+[a](<https://example.com>"test")
+[a](https://example.com(test))
+[a](<https://example.com>(test))
+
+[a](https://example.com "test")
+[a](<https://example.com> "test")
